This profile opted out of bundled-skill seeding.

The engine seeds its own skills into every profile: apple-notes, imessage, social-media,
songwriting, and dozens more. They are good skills for a general-purpose assistant and the wrong
ones for a food business's machine, so pantler ships this marker and the engine seeds only
ESSENTIAL_SKILLS (hermes-agent, its own operating manual, which cannot be removed).

Delete this file and the next `hermes update` will re-seed the bundled set into this profile.
